Subject: [PATCH] test(claude-eval): G194 counter-review probes of Qdrant
 candidates in canonical recall

Pinned: lexical recall without index, canonical reread with provenance,
no automatic sync (new documents invisible until an explicit upsert or
rebuild), previous generations kept. Strict xfail findings: Q1 no
abstention in index mode, Q2 archives excluded because the production
index emits no passage reference, Q3 orphan generation after a failed
rebuild.

